#. こんな緊張感のあるゲームなんて、
#. そう体験できるもんじゃない…
msgctxt "0001 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"It's not often you get to experience a game as\n"
"exciting as this."
msgstr ""

#. やるからには、楽しまんとな…
msgctxt "0002 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"If we absolutely must go through this, I have to\n"
"make sure I at least have fun."
msgstr ""

#. 一緒に過ごす
msgctxt "0003 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "Spend some time with Byakuya"
msgstr ""

#. 他の場所へ行く
msgctxt "0004 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "Go see who else is around"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>…どうしよう？
#. 十神クンと一緒に過ごそうか？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0005 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Hmm... Should I hang out with Byakuya for a while?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. …弱ったな。
msgctxt "0006 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "So weak..."
msgstr ""

#. 俺はお前という人間に、
#. まったく興味がないんだ…
msgctxt "0007 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "I have no interest in a commoner like you."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>なじられながらも、
#. 十神クンと一緒に過ごした…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0008 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I ignored the insults, and spent some time with\n"
"Byakuya.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>十神クンと少し仲良くなれたみたいだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0009 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Byakuya and I grew a little closer today.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. 渡す
msgctxt "0010 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "Yes, definitely"
msgstr ""

#. 渡さない
msgctxt "0011 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "Not really, no"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 3>プレゼント<CLT><CLT 23>を渡しますか？<CLT>
msgctxt "0012 | NARRATION"
msgid "<CLT 3><CLT><CLT 23>Would you like to give Byakuya a<CLT> <CLT 3>present<CLT><CLT 23>?<CLT>"
msgstr ""
